    <!-- Section 9 - Offer -->
    <h2>Where to get the real BetterLungs range (and what the order actually includes)</h2>

    <div class="vy-dli-image-block">
      <img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/vysta/lp-676-betterbrand/images/img-12.jpg" alt="BetterLungs Mullein and Chlorophyll tincture beside the BetterLungs Mullein Gummies pouch">
      <p class="vy-dli-image-caption">Results may vary from person to person</p>
    </div>
    
    <p>Here is the catch I promised. Once mullein started showing up everywhere online, the copycats followed. A lot of what gets sold as a mullein tincture is a vague herbal blend with no extract ratio on the label, a base of alcohol, and not much else in the bottle. If you buy one of those, take it for a month, and decide mullein is overhyped, that is not the plant letting you down. That is the bottle.</p>

    <p>The one I have been taking every morning is <a href="https://www.trybetterbrand.com/products/betterlungs%C2%AE-mullein-chlorophyll?variant=50211235954987" class="vy-dli-product-link">BetterLungs&#174; Mullein + Chlorophyll</a>, which puts 280 mg of a 10:1 mullein leaf extract in every serving, the herbal equivalent of 2,800 mg, alongside 100 mg of chlorophyll, and no alcohol at all. Betterbrand sells it through its own site rather than through marketplaces, and backs every order with a 365-Day Guarantee.</p>

    <p>Here is what you actually get when you order direct:</p>

    <ul class="vy-dli-offer-list">
      <li>&#9989;  $34.95 for a 30 day supply, or $94.35 and $178.20 for the 3 and 6 packs if you want the better per bottle price</li>
      <li>&#9989;  Both formats are available: the Mullein + Chlorophyll tincture in Original or Mint, and the pear flavored Mullein Gummies</li>
      <li>&#9989;  HSA/FSA eligible, which works out to an average saving of 30%</li>
      <li>&#9989;  365-Day Guarantee, and it is made in the USA and formulated by a pharmacist.</li>
    </ul>

    <p>A new supplement takes a few days to become automatic, and a bit longer before you know whether the taste and the routine suit you. A full year is plenty of time to <span class="vy-dli-bold">work that out before you commit to anything</span>.*</p>
    
    <a href="https://www.trybetterbrand.com/products/betterlungs%C2%AE-mullein-chlorophyll?variant=50211235954987" class="vy-dli-cta-btn">&#128073; CHECK AVAILABILITY &#187;</a>

    <!-- Section 10 -->
    <h2>Why the BetterLungs range gets busy at this time of year</h2>

    <div class="vy-dli-image-block">
      <img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/vysta/lp-676-betterbrand/images/img-13.jpg" alt="Hands holding the BetterLungs Mullein and Chlorophyll bottle on a wooden kitchen counter">
    </div>
    
    <p>Heading into allergy season, <a href="https://www.trybetterbrand.com/products/betterlungs%C2%AE-mullein-chlorophyll?variant=50211235954987" class="vy-dli-product-link">BetterLungs&#174;</a> has been getting a lot of attention from people who would rather start a daily routine before allergy season than think about it halfway through. Spring is a busy stretch for anything in this category, so it is worth a quick look at what is in stock rather than assuming both flavors will be sitting there.</p>

    <p>If the promotion shown on the product page is still live when you click through, you can check the current <span class="vy-dli-bold">pricing and availability for both formats</span> on Betterbrand&rsquo;s own site.</p>

